; The In-game mode draws the root viewport through the scene's current Camera3D, not the editor
; orbit. Each current camera claims the viewport in tree order, and the last claim wins
; (`viewport.cpp:4565-4581`), so the view is `Near`'s. With no WorldEnvironment, no project
; environment and no light, Godot draws the clear colour and a box lit by no preview sun or sky.

